#: src/content/docs/best-practices/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended ways to work with Ditana — system snapshots, package management, and virtual machines."
msgstr "Modas recumandadas da lavurar cun Ditana – snapshots dal sistem, administraziun dals pachets e maschinas virtualas."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Best practices"
msgstr "Bunas praticas"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/index.md
msgid ""
"A short collection of recommended practices for getting the most out of "
"Ditana. These are not exhaustive manuals — they cover the choices most "
"likely to come up in day-to-day use, where Ditana's defaults make "
"assumptions that are worth understanding."
msgstr ""
"Ina curta collecziun da praticas recumandadas per profitar il meglier "
"pussaivel da Ditana. I na sa tracta betg da manuals cumplets – ellas tractan "
"las decisiuns che sa preschentan il pli probabel en il diever da mintgadi, "
"nua che las valurs da standard da Ditana fan supposiziuns ch’i vala la paina "
"da chapir."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/index.md
#: src/content/docs/under-the-hood/index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Available pages"
msgstr "Paginas disponiblas"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/index.md
msgid ""
"[**Automatic system snapshots**](/best-practices/automatic-system-"
"snapshots/) — how snapshots are configured, and how to roll back from the "
"rescue system if your install ever fails to boot."
msgstr ""
"[**Snapshots automatics dal sistem**](/best-practices/automatic-system-"
"snapshots/) – co ch’ils snapshots vegnan configurads e co restaurar il "
"sistem a partir dal sistem da salvament, sche Vossa installaziun na "
"s’aviescha ina giada betg."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/index.md
msgid ""
"[**AUR vs Flatpak**](/best-practices/aur-vs-flatpak/) — when to reach for "
"which, and why Ditana ships Brave from AUR rather than Flathub."
msgstr ""
"[**AUR u Flatpak**](/best-practices/aur-vs-flatpak/) – cura recurrer a l’in "
"e cura a l’auter, e pertge che Ditana furnescha Brave dad AUR e betg da "
"Flathub."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/index.md
msgid ""
"[**Virtual machines**](/best-practices/virtual-machines/) — which "
"hypervisors provide full 3D support for modern Wayland desktops, and which "
"to avoid."
msgstr ""
"[**Maschinas virtualas**](/best-practices/virtual-machines/) – tgenins "
"hypervisors che porschan in sustegn 3D cumplet per desktops Wayland moderns, "
"e tgenins che Vus duessas evitar."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/index.md
msgid ""
"More pages will be added as common questions emerge. If something you'd "
"expect to find here is missing, [open an issue](https://github.com/acrion/"
"ditana-installer/issues) or email support@ditana.org — best-practice topics "
"are driven by what users actually run into."
msgstr ""
"Ulteriuras paginas vegnan agiuntadas cura che dumondas frequentas sa "
"preschentan. Sch’i manca insatge che Vus spetgassas da chattar qua, [avri in "
"issue](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-installer/issues) u scrivai in e-"
"mail a support@ditana.org – ils temas da las bunas praticas sa drizzan tenor "
"quai che las utilisadras ed ils utilisaders scuntran effectivamain."
